Cell["\<\
Encodes the interaction-net annihilation law: two matching nodes meeting \
head-on disappear, joining their remaining legs pairwise.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"f714d470-4bf3-4e57-afc4-3e2898ce0773"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7577a53e-8950-40ef-9a03-b7fa21e3ab2e"],

